{"product_id":"pod-salt-pachamama-strawberry-kiwi-ice","title":"POD SALT - Pacha Mama Strawberry Kiwi Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eA fruity blend of ripe strawberries and tropical kiwi finished with a smooth, icy exhale. A magical earthiness lives deep in this all-day vaping experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInspired by the Incan Goddess, Pacha Mama represents all the goodness of Mother Nature. Her influence extends beyond the Andes and into your senses as you enjoy this original and refreshing E-liquid. The sweet fragrance of ripe strawberry blends beautifully with tropical kiwi notes, bringing you an essence of spring that will heighten your senses.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780191799,"sku":"POD S - Pacha Mama Strawberry Kiwi Ice 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"25mg\/ml (2.5% Nicotine","offer_id":41710998290487,"sku":"POD S - Pacha Mama Strawberry Kiwi Ice 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780224567,"sku":"POD S - Pacha Mama Strawberry Kiwi Ice 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-pacha-mama-strawberry-kiwi-ice.jpg?v=1749916771","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/pod-salt-pachamama-strawberry-kiwi-ice","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"